  partName: Oil Pan Gasket (9)
  description: The Oil Pan Gasket (9) is a tiny, thin-flat gasket positioned at the
    bottom-center-front, also made of Material.008, similar to Oil Pan Gasket (8).
    It contributes to the overall sealing of the oil pan, preventing oil spills and
    maintaining engine performance. One interesting detail about this gasket is its
    ability to conform to slight irregularities in the oil pan surface, ensuring
    a secure seal.
